OL,4,CNew Zealand's ruling coalition falls   
OL,5,Cshort of parliamentary majority by one 
OL,6,Cseat                                   
OL,7,GNew Zealand's ruling coalition has     
OL,8,Gfallen short of a parliamentary        
OL,9,Gmajority by one seat, following a      
OL,10,Gcampaign shaped by a sluggish economy  
OL,11,Gand disillusioned voters.              
OL,13,FIt now needs the support of the        
OL,14,Fcentrist Opportunity Party to remain   
OL,15,Fin power. If they cannot reach a deal, 
OL,16,Fthe country may have to go back to the 
OL,17,Fpolls.                                 
